  - "V\xEC ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ta mang c\xE2y v\xE0o tr\u1ED3ng"
  - "V\xEC hang n\u1EB1m d\u01B0\u1EDBi \u0111\xE1y bi\u1EC3n"
  - "V\xEC c\xE2y trong hang kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n \xE1nh s\xE1ng"
